     "dwFlags": 0,
     "szComment": "Player RAISES the TORCH up to the Tree. The white flame licks at the bark. The tree GROANS, nervous. \r\n\r\nAnd then, as if lit by accelerant, the fire CATCHES. It SNAKES up the tree's side faster than the eye can move, up into the branches. \r\n\r\nPlayer and Tyrael take a few steps back.  \r\n\r\nThe heads SHRIEK together. \r\n\r\nBut LORATH'S HEAD is quiet. No shouts, no screams. He closes his eyes, at peace... \r\n\r\nPlayer swallows, looking up at Lorath. There are tears in their eyes. \r\n\r\nPLAYER AND TYRAEL stand silhouetted before the burning tree, watching the flames devour it. \r\n\r\nThe TREE COLLAPSES. \r\n\r\nPlayer and Tyrael stare at the smoldering fire. ",
